    "name": "School-Management-API",
    "description": "# School Management API\n\nThe **School Management API** is a RESTful backend service designed to manageoperations of a school ecosystem. It provides endpoints for registering schools, and listing schools.\n\n## Base URL\n\nAll endpoints are relative to the base URL configured via the `{{baseURL}}` collection variable (e.g., `http://localhost:3000`).\n\n## API Modules\n\n### 🏫 Schools\n\nRegister and manage school entities within the system.\n\n| Method | Endpoint | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `POST` | `/api/v1/addSchool/` | Register a new school |\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. Set the `{{baseURL}}` collection variable to your server's base URL (e.g., `http://localhost:3000`).\n    \n2. Use the **Add School** endpoint to register a school\n    \n3. Use the List School Endpoint with providing query of latitute and longitude to list schools with proximity",
